cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the prediction files, please cite the manuscript and the C-MAPSS dataset."
title: "Bounded stage-adaptive memory for remaining useful life prediction of turbofan engines"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-01
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/qazwsed13/srnl-rul"
authors:
  - family-names: Chai
    given-names: Yimeng
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-7131-7674"
    affiliation: "School of Mechanical Engineering, North China University of Water Resources and Electric Power"
abstract: >-
  Code, one-shot test predictions, and evidence for a 1D five-memory
  self-referential nested-learning encoder with bounded memory dynamics for
  C-MAPSS remaining useful life prediction. The repository is released for
  reproducibility; it does not support a state-of-the-art accuracy claim.
